-- src:4099 | furnished or given, be published; and, except for the purposes of a
-- src:4100 | prosecution under this Act, any person not engaged in connection
-- src:4101 | with the collection or preparation of statistics under this Act must not
-- src:4102 | be permitted to see any such individual return or any such part of an
-- src:4103 | individual return.
@ref s 102(1) (src:4094-4103)
GIVEN `the previous written consent of the person having the control, management or superintendence was given` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 102(1) the return or answer must not be published` MEANS
    IF NOT `the previous written consent of the person having the control, management or superintendence was given`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "without the previous written consent of the person having the control"
    ELSE JUST FALSE

-- s 102(1), second limb: "except for the purposes of a prosecution under this Act, any person not engaged in
-- connection with the collection or preparation of statistics under this Act must not be permitted to see any such
-- individual return or any such part of an individual return."
@ref s 102(1) (src:4094-4103)
